haotic, and unpredictable faction of shapeshifters who are swarming the Dragonvault. They are controlled by advanced AI or even other players, which makes them extremely unpredictable. You will constantly make exciting decisions on whether to avoid, assault, or even briefly team up with them to best achieve your own plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/61b963c0fe4003fa598f8c7ac385017b.poster.avif?t=1751010561\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/61b963c0fe4003fa598f8c7ac385017b.webm?t=1751010561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/61b963c0fe4003fa598f8c7ac385017b.mp4?t=1751010561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/23fd55b6916edb89500671e535f679aa.avif?t=1751010561\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill is everything. Attacks are punishing, but can all be avoided. Enemies are vulnerable when attacking, enabling you to deal double damage if you time it just right. However, not all fights are wise to engage in, and you\u2019ll always have to think twice before taking risky actions. From tense exploration where ambushes can happen around every corner to epic multi-group fights, you will always have to think on your feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/54bba52d909a927d3b292c1b2d051210.poster.avif?t=1751010561\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/54bba52d909a927d3b292c1b2d051210.webm?t=1751010561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/54bba52d909a927d3b292c1b2d051210.mp4?t=1751010561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/2da445af6f77cb793788164541a7160f.avif?t=1751010561\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vaultbreakers offers many ways to progress and customize exactly to your liking and playstyle. You choose between various Champions, unlock and equip varied perks to alter their abilities, loot -or craft- items to boost your power, obtain new abilities, and awaken Artifacts to uncover unique passive powers. With these, you grow stronger or even learn abilities that help you traverse the world in new ways, like vaulting across the environment on plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/5db7385748f401ba1ec90321aba7a516.poster.avif?t=1751010561\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/5db7385748f401ba1ec90321aba7a516.webm?t=1751010561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/5db7385748f401ba1ec90321aba7a516.mp4?t=1751010561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/374b6026bea3b4ee63557f57e7cd9dd3.avif?t=1751010561\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a champion of the Vaultguard, an order dedicated to protecting the world from ancient, dark forces that threaten to rise once more. Immerse yourself in the lore-rich universe, interact with varied NPCs that send you on all manner of quests, and discover the world as you work your way toward the Dragonvault. Keep coming back for the competitive player ranking and climb the leaderboard by completing an endless variety of competitive challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/a9e2f7169fe7de10cbb429208465b351.poster.avif?t=1751010561\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/a9e2f7169fe7de10cbb429208465b351.webm?t=1751010561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/a9e2f7169fe7de10cbb429208465b351.mp4?t=1751010561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
